#!RuleTest
#test CT-RUN-1 expect=violation domain=VS
#note CTD-2 row T1 — blank field, no define, the Trial Summary states CDISC CT 2024-09-27 (TSVCDREF/TSVCDVER) and the store holds it: the run takes its CT from TS, the codelist resolves, the rule fires, and the run note names the source (CQ7 (a)).
#ct-available sdtmct-2024-09-27
#expect-ct-mismatch "CT taken from the Trial Summary: sdtmct-2024-09-27 (TSVCDREF \"CDISC CT\", TSVCDVER \"2024-09-27\")"
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset VS
col VSSTAT type=Char
---
BOGUS
---

dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
col TSVCDREF type=Char
col TSVCDVER type=Char
---
S1 | TCNTRL | PLACEBO | CDISC CT | 2024-09-27
S1 | TRT | DRUG A | UNII | 2024
---
